# Phase discipline

Read [docs/master-spec.md](docs/master-spec.md) and the current phase doc before changing code.

Work only on the current phase. Phase 6 is complete and accepted. See [docs/phase-6.md](docs/phase-6.md). Phase 1 through Phase 5 are complete. Do not start Phase 7 until the user says so. See [docs/phase-7.md](docs/phase-7.md).

Feature work happens on `develop`. Merge to `main` only when the user is ready for production.

Phase 6 stored encrypted, trade-only keys on Connected Exchange accounts. Bybit is the first enabled venue. Do not place exchange orders. Do not add a Fly.io worker. Do not call private exchange APIs from the browser. Paper accounts still use the Phase 4 paper ledger. The tick must not execute Connected Exchange books. Paper auto-switch is postponed.

Do not create later-phase tables or speculative architecture.

Keep dependencies minimal. Prefer the simplest solution that satisfies the current phase.

Stop at the end of the phase. After acceptance criteria pass, report results and wait for instruction.
